<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-NORTHERN TRANSVAAL BEAT QUEENSLAND 14-3.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NORTHERN TRANSVAAL BEAT QUEENSLAND 14-3.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Transvaal beat Queensland 14-3 (halftime 14-3) in their Super 12 match at Loftus Versfeld on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal - Tries: Joost van der Westhuizen (2). Conversions: Theo Van Rensburg (2)</p>
<p>Queensland: - Penalty: John Eales.</p>
